I have the same basic idea, but with the following steps:

1. Before:
-----------
--> pwd
/etc/zoneinfo

--> zdump -v CST6CDT|grep 2007
CST6CDT  Sun Apr  1 07:59:59 2007 GMT = Sun Apr  1 01:59:59 2007 CST
isdst=0 gmtoff=-21600
CST6CDT  Sun Apr  1 08:00:00 2007 GMT = Sun Apr  1 03:00:00 2007 CDT
isdst=1 gmtoff=-18000
CST6CDT  Sun Oct 28 06:59:59 2007 GMT = Sun Oct 28 01:59:59 2007 CDT
isdst=1 gmtoff=-18000
CST6CDT  Sun Oct 28 07:00:00 2007 GMT = Sun Oct 28 01:00:00 2007 CST
isdst=0 gmtoff=-21600

2. Verify that your tzdata files are incorrect
("zdump -v CST6CDT | grep 2007"; noted above).

3.  Downloaded the timezone data file from "ftp://elsie.nci.nih.gov/
pub";
    filename is "tzdata2007a.tar.gz".

4.  Gunzip'ed and un-tar'ed the data file in /var/TZ_Related/tzdata.

5.  Run the following commands to create the timezone images:
    #cd /var/TZ_Related/tzdata
    #zic -d ./tmp ./northamerica

6. mv /etc/zoneinfo/localtime /etc/zoneinfo/localtime.old
   mv /etc/zoneinfo/CST6CDT /etc/zoneinfo/CST6CDT.old
   mv /etc/zoneinfo/US/Central /etc/zoneinfo/US/Central.old
   mv /etc/zoneinfo/America/Chicago /etc/zoneinfo/America/Chicago.orig

   From "/var/TZ_Related/tzdata/tmp":

   cp CST6CDT /etc/zoneinfo/CST6CDT
   cp CST6CDT /etc/zoneinfo/US/Central
   cp America/Chicago /etc/zoneinfo/America
   ln -s /etc/zoneinfo/America/Chicago /etc/zoneinfo/localtime

   NOTE:  I only moved the tzdata files applicable to the Central
timezone.

7. After:
----------

--> pwd
/etc/zoneinfo

--> file localtime
localtime:      symbolic link to ./America/Chicago

--> date
Thu Feb  8 19:56:50 CST 2007

--> zdump -v /etc/zoneinfo/America/Chicago|grep 2007

/etc/zoneinfo/America/Chicago  Sun Mar 11 07:59:59 2007 GMT = Sun Mar
11 01:59:59 2007 CST isdst=0 gmtoff=-21600

/etc/zoneinfo/America/Chicago  Sun Mar 11 08:00:00 2007 GMT = Sun Mar
11 03:00:00 2007 CDT isdst=1 gmtoff=-18000

/etc/zoneinfo/America/Chicago  Sun Nov  4 06:59:59 2007 GMT = Sun Nov
4 01:59:59 2007 CDT isdst=1 gmtoff=-18000

/etc/zoneinfo/America/Chicago  Sun Nov  4 07:00:00 2007 GMT = Sun Nov
4 01:00:00 2007 CST isdst=0 gmtoff=-21600

